    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks for the message! I've been really busy at work lately. How about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:28:24.897285+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, you're busy. Are you doing any yoga?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:28:54.096999+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, I do a bit of yoga. It's actually quite relaxing, but not as much as stretching.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:29:25.082086+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear you're doing some yoga. I used to do stretching, but it doesn't work as well for me anymore. How about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:30:27.323806+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Haha, it's good to hear that! I used to do some stretching too, but it's been a long time since I really put any effort into it. I feel like I need to work on my flexibility again.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:31:49.582712+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "You know what? I'm in the gym all the time. I usually go for a workout twice a week, Monday and Friday. Do you do any stretching, or is that something you only do on vacation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:32:39.572032+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, you're always on the gym! That must be great for your flexibility.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:34:15.202353+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my gosh, you're always on the gym! That is so cool for you!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:37:21.518018+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, your dedication to staying in shape is impressive. What kind of workout are you doing? I'd love to try that if I could fit in!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:39:42.138257+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, I didn't expect to hear that from you!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:56.915874+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow! That's really surprising. What's up?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T23:50:03.873842+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, I didn't expect you to say that! I don't know why you would say that. But, okay, I guess we are just two friends talking about different things!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T00:30:25.408407+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I think we'll have to see. I don't know what you're talking about, but I wouldn't want to miss our meeting.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T00:34:53.596520+00:00"
    },
    {
